These ten points cover most of the issues found in audits.

## Structure

- a single `h1` per page and hierarchical headings;
- landmarks: `header`, `nav`, `main`, `footer`;
- a skip link to the content.

## Interaction

- everything is usable **with the keyboard**;
- focus is always visible;
- form fields have a label.
